# Includes, not pages. Every file here expects SP_ADMIN to be defined and the
# config to be loaded; requested directly they would run without a session and
# without an authorisation check.
#
# Each file also refuses to run on its own, so this is the second of two locks.
# The first is in the code, where it cannot be lost by a deploy that rewrites
# the site's .htaccess files.
Require all denied
